 * - Left resizable/collapsible Split (`left_panel` / `left` / `explorer`)
 * - Center sticky header slot (`top_bar` / `header` / `toolbar`)
 * - Center main content slot (`main` / `content`)
 * - Center bottom resizable/collapsible vertical Split (`bottom_panel` / `bottom` / `panel` / `console` / `terminal`)
 * - Right resizable/collapsible Split (`right_panel` / `right` / `inspector`)
 * - Full-width bottom Status Bar (`status_bar`)
 */
class WorkbenchLayout extends BaseWorkbenchLayout {}
